This is its own work: a SoapySDR module written for two HackRF boards.
It follows the conventions SoapySDR users of a HackRF already know (the
gain element names, the buffers stream argument) so that applications
written for a single board work with the pair, and takes no code from
any other module.

Third-party works this project uses are listed in docs/licensing.md.
